WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.774 line:91%
Chapter 15. More: the timetable, two schools, and settings.

00:00:06.193 --> 00:00:13.656 line:91%
Do you teach in two schools? Open "More", then "Settings". Press "Add a school", write its name, and press "Save".

00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:27.214 line:91%
Then choose the school of each class: on the Students page, open "Class details", and choose the school. Press "Save class".

00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:35.134 line:91%
Now open "Timetable". There is a tab for each school.

00:00:35.599 --> 00:00:40.236 line:91%
Choose a class, then tap its hours. Then press "Save timetable".

00:00:45.186 --> 00:00:53.434 line:91%
The app now knows your classes. At class time, it opens the right class by itself. Home shows your classes of the day.

00:00:53.889 --> 00:00:57.955 line:91%
In Settings, you also find the colours, light or dark.

00:00:58.656 --> 00:01:06.035 line:91%
Focus during tests: a student who leaves the quiz for 3 seconds gets that question wrong, and you see it.

00:01:06.494 --> 00:01:16.354 line:91%
Press "Save a backup" every few weeks, and keep the file on Google Drive. On a new phone or a laptop, install the app, and restore the backup.

00:01:16.808 --> 00:01:24.854 line:91%
"Help and videos" has short answers for every part of the app, and all these videos. Type a word to find a topic.

00:01:25.314 --> 00:01:32.514 line:91%
Files you save are in "Downloads, MI WAY". Move your classes between this phone and a laptop with a backup.
